{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01157","headline":"相和歌辞 猛虎行 · 韩愈","name":"相和歌辞 猛虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛虎虽云恶，亦各有匹侪。\n羣行深谷间，百兽望风低。\n身食黄熊父，子食赤豹麛。\n择肉於熊罴，肎视兔与狸。\n正昼当谷眠，眼有百步威。\n自矜无当对，气性纵以乖。\n朝怒杀其子，暮还飧其妃。\n匹侪四散走，猛虎还孤栖。\n狐鸣门四旁，乌鹊从噪之。\n出逐猴入居，虎不知所归。\n谁云猛虎恶，中路正悲啼。\n豹来衔其尾，熊来攫其颐。\n猛虎死不辞，但慙前所爲。\n虎坐无助死，况如汝细微。\n故当结以信，亲当结以私。\n亲故且不保，人谁信汝爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}